  <item>
    <title>论抵抗孤独，书和酒旗鼓相当：和胡一刀聊独立书店</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/698c945566e2c303770f0118</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">698c945566e2c303770f0118</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Feb 2026 14:47:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>各位听友好，一转眼已经到了2026年，这是我们新年的第一更！本期我们邀请到了（另）一位独立书店的主理人——杭州尤利西斯的老板胡一刀老师。胡一刀老师的尤利西斯书店，能开出来是要对抗中年危机，能开出名堂是因为有自己的标准和坚持，当然能开到现在主要还是因为房子是自己的。两个小时的时间里我们边喝边聊，聊独立书店，聊中年危机，聊“网红打卡”，聊脱口秀，聊买书，聊喝酒，甚至还聊到了猫......新的一年我们约定了在杭州再喝一顿、录一期，也欢迎大家去杭州的时候到尤利西斯书店看看！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="117">00:01:57</a> 什么是独立书店？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1435">00:23:55</a> 实体书是生活里确定的温度</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1631">00:27:11</a> 书店就应该“丑”一点？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2685">00:44:45</a> 脱口秀是酒吧和咖啡馆的临终关怀？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3622">01:00:22</a> “尤利西斯书店有猫吗？”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4470">01:14:30</a> 爱书店的人</span></p><p><span>尤利西斯书店</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnVodS5vSpYn0fTa69TACH82ZygI.jpg"></figure><p><span>并不“丑”的内部</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgxNNsw2OsSN_FdKOQsm9sfDwa-Y.jpg"></figure><p><span>尤利西斯书店的猫猫</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsKvkaFenv51MivhU0m-Nlk2oe5A.jpg"></figure><p><span>剪辑：竹取赫夜子</span></p><p><span>🎵：If This World Were Mine</span><br></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/643d5699ea2628837e622346/lk6SbHNI0vj0lt0CR3vP16U90hV3.m4a" length="95106920" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:38:18</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoqQBw2S7scL8IVJ19XhoFrRbJiy.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
