  <item>
    <title>请你丑一眼，淘宝丑东西</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68ac9f97293471fed46f83bb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68ac9f97293471fed46f83bb</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 26 Aug 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🍻各位听友好～又是一期好久不见带</span><strong><span>观众录制</span></strong><span>的更新！这期都在酒里了是我和大雄老师（@</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6453e2a5badcf33cf4f2b5a7" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6453e2a5badcf33cf4f2b5a7"><span>靠边停车主播</span></a><span>）携「不开玩笑」团队闪现杭州——淘宝丑东西</span><strong><span>x</span></strong><span>中国美院联合整活大展：《丑时已到》🎉🎉</span></p><span></span><p><span>咱们就是说，平常大家都是卷生卷死卷审美，但淘宝丑东西展反手就是一个“丑拒内卷”，直接把那些不按套路出牌的丑宝们拉出来亮相，无声呐喊：美是公约数，丑是我喜欢！一整个震撼！幽默！ai不能代替人类...</span></p><span></span><p><span>此次活动现场也有不少听友热情向我们进行了互动，分享出很多自己的丑东西珍藏：有鞋有包有盲盒，有猫有狗甚至有自己…让我和大雄老师对听友们丰（chou）富（xiang）多（zhi）彩（ji）的生活直呼麦艾斯！麦艾斯！</span></p><span></span><p><span>📢我们也已经出了一些视频cut在不开玩笑</span><a href=" https://xhslink.com/m/75gdKQVE7ts" data-url=" https://xhslink.com/m/75gdKQVE7ts"><span>📕小红书</span></a><span>和</span><a href="https://v.douyin.com/mE1Fr9lLR7g/ 5@7.com :" data-url="https://v.douyin.com/mE1Fr9lLR7g/ 5@7.com :"><span>🎶抖音</span></a><span>的官方账号，欢迎大家关注～</span></p><span></span><p><span>相信大家都曾为不少美而驻足过，但我希望这场展的丑能和生活中所有出其不意的惊喜一样使你会心一笑～</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏰时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="39">00:00:39</a>史炎的丑袋子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="101">00:01:41</a>寓意很好的紫裤衩绿巨人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">00:03:10</a>怀旧ip的丑拖鞋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="275">00:04:35</a>三个火呛手女装票根</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">00:07:10</a>会说话的小爆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="557">00:09:17</a>升职加薪的招财狗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="623">00:10:23</a>喜欢强制爱的刚子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="727">00:12:07</a>淘宝聚划算的“植入”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="855">00:14:15</a>有生命力的丑盆栽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1002">00:16:42</a>噗嗤十周年，老友携柏林护士主唱照片惊喜闪现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1165">00:19:25</a>考研中国美院的失败练习稿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1327">00:22:07</a>泡泡玛特丑盲盒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1437">00:23:57</a>十年前的科学作业和把小孩吓哭的丑蚂蚁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1605">00:26:45</a>陶瓷便便以及美好祝福</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1731">00:28:51</a>明星丑娃以及不开玩笑音频主播的外形想象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1992">00:33:12</a>哲学的下蛋鸡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2135">00:35:35</a>“真·焊子”装置艺术和政府丑项目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2507">00:41:47</a>稀巴烂的西兰花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2699">00:44:59</a>霸道总裁和蟑螂手机壳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2899">00:48:19</a>贵价丑包（如萍口吻：好贵呢，要两千块）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2996">00:49:56</a>三年前的自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3305">00:55:05</a>大脑纹路的丑帽子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3374">00:56:14</a>长得像大雄的玩偶</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq0pXRE9WNpvg8pqYFdKu0qidAEm.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆史炎的丑袋子和紫裤衩绿巨人（亮点自寻）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs1xaWd-qdmLNmZYhBbwcCDC3GIS.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆怀旧丑拖鞋和三种票根</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnqtFcpywpFKISmuWKPps3ZjOcLP.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆会说话小爆（哪里丑了？）和招财的狗</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FllvlkF3yFDAAIfN0hyqYqGGsMZ-.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆刚子和淘宝聚划算的包（是不是和主人很像？）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgUD2ThfrDDhA6V3O4MwunCyAquj.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆丑盆栽和柏林护士乐队主唱照片的扇子</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrXD4aYPQXdBrRw9dZzV_Rfaj2EW.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆失败的练习稿和泡泡玛特丑盲盒</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnEU_Z2lpzb6Cn7IgwaXLqIkbRYC.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆手工地球仪、蚂蚁丑玩具和陶瓷便便</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frz-Bvx6H2OOKDTUafO6ALDYMPhS.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆丑娃和感觉盯人看的丑包</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FomgR1NV6GvKlcBeXTzrE0nJKixC.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆扯蛋鸡和机器鸟</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkZVTN34rpAxjiOr4NWkT_KgpxmE.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆西兰花和霸道总裁、蟑螂手机壳</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiE27Sunbv9kNJbYEFFHLdJOlxFG.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆年轻人衰老穿搭和贵价丑包</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl9cPowO-g_2JKbglvmg5Lm-ZRPL.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆像大雄的玩偶、脑花帽子以及现场进行佩戴的史炎</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtzTxzdruhjwzl7sR6O95wJQlkWm.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆主播、听友全体大合照！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM：丑八怪</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期、发布：竹取赫夜子</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/643d5699ea2628837e622346/lkmYsI0L2QnbDwfyHGVPIjCghpf5.m4a" length="57329636" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:59:15</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoqQBw2S7scL8IVJ19XhoFrRbJiy.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>上海就是上海，无论你爱或不爱</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6872133593fd2d72b8cdb961</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6872133593fd2d72b8cdb961</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 12 Jul 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🍻又是一期更新，这期都在酒里了身为河北人的我邀请到了我的两位老学长，安徽人生菜（@</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6638714f0d564095f98db627" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6638714f0d564095f98db627"><span>生菜日日谭主播</span></a><span>），山东人马路和饮水思源BBS末代站长 湖南人学妹cmm来聊一聊对于我们来说从异乡变成故乡的上海。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这座特别的城市，既有海纳百川的包容，又有井水不犯河水的边界感，相信你们听这期的时候会听到这座城的呓语——上海：你准备呆多久，我该准备咖啡还是陪伴你一生…</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏰时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">00:11:00</a>册那，是洋泾浜呀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1736">00:28:56</a>魔都初印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3500">00:58:20</a>卖给上海人？卖给上海的人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3937">01:05:37</a>i人天堂，边界感是城市默契</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4249">01:10:49</a> 城的魔力转圈圈，爱你爱到每个细节黑夜白天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5794">01:36:34</a> 文化共建：呼吸同一片空的气息，也拥抱在一起</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjryAeZLAwofX66sKJx_I86oyg5z.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆四位交大同学用手势摆出SJTU（从左到右依次为生菜、马路、史炎、cmm）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi6QyvwJHRVwKW_1MkkZsF8VFnPW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆2003年马路和试点班同学在只有东方明珠的陆家嘴</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FukkVkBn67yfr07DH_aba66BZ9gb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆2004年马路在正在播放宝贝对不起的徐太</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵bgm：魔都·魔都</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期制作：竹取赫夜子</span></p>]]></description>
