  <item>
    <title>不必纠结苏超是什么 激情快乐就够了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/685a360e2a38b4d9793b4a57</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">685a360e2a38b4d9793b4a57</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 24 Jun 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🍻hello hello各位听友，又是一次久违的更新，本期节目作为和A座B座的串台，和我的老友江苏人迟斌（</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66a2678ae29aab785c2ec367" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66a2678ae29aab785c2ec367"><span>@A座B座主播</span></a><span>）还有脱口秀足球赛道唯一选手、前足球评论员马军老师</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/63d5f6838173da79c989010b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/63d5f6838173da79c989010b"><span>（@今馬講主播）</span></a><span>一起聊了足球版“散装江苏”的狂欢--苏超，这也是我们作为足球爱好者久违的一次狂欢。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当足球撞上地域梗，热血和幽默并存，10块票价撬动万员球场，比赛第一友谊第十四，没有假球只有真·恩怨，纯粹、心跳、不可预测，潦潦草草却风风火火..总结：低票价！高热度！强归属感！话不多说，快来用耳朵加入这场狂欢盛宴～</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏰时间轴——</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="181">00:03:01</a>看似偶然实为必然的苏超出圈，理一理中国足球版图</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="554">00:09:14</a>散装江苏，没有假球，只有世仇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="737">00:12:17</a>端碗不等于好饭，职业不等于专业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1466">00:24:26</a> 足球梗玩得好，官方下场少不了～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2386">00:39:46</a> 绿茵原色，赤足之心，为谁而战的情怀？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2967">00:49:27</a>足球不应在云端漫步，而应踢入寻常百姓家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3203">00:53:23</a> 足球请柬，城市名片，只有坚持沉淀才能顶峰相见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4055">01:07:35</a> 我场大门常打开，欢迎大家来看球！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵bgm：拼出精彩</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期、发布：竹取赫夜子</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/643d5699ea2628837e622346/lgJMFmdpWgNH8YKhpxx8Vppw3rUk.m4a" length="109321149" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:15:31</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoqQBw2S7scL8IVJ19XhoFrRbJiy.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>青春不毕业：聊聊交大闵行校区的古早故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680dbd1b7a449ae858ed30ae</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">680dbd1b7a449ae858ed30ae</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Apr 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🍻各位听友大家好，欢迎收听本期「都在酒里了」，熟悉我的朋友都知道我有个标签就是交大毕业的，那本期节目我邀请到了蔡向罡学长、高明学长，和yolanda 学妹，几位分别来自不同届、系，但我们今天用一个共同的身份——交大学子，分别从衣、食、住，行的角度聊一聊我们学习生活过的闵行校区以及校园里那些让我们直呼青春值得的moment ～</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎交大学子的你加入上海交通大学 青春不毕业（上海）校友合唱团——</span><a href="https://www.wjx.cn/vm/rLmdrMD.aspx#" data-url="https://www.wjx.cn/vm/rLmdrMD.aspx#"><span>招新链接🔗</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>也欢迎无论是不是交大学子的你，有什么关于校园生活记忆犹新的人或事在评论区和我们进行分享～</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiFxCoOkPiwglfYxX-XKQwp3U8Kx.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆不同面额的交大食堂饭票</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvelwCdQ4NusMT3eITbD4n2Y-_CL.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆1991年上院500毕业告别演唱会（左一蔡学长）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpkL4C12nRmoPpcZ4GpnLgU_SY0D.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆当年的蔡学长和小芸学姐</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs-4iNIEaIts00WCgeu40M9paYOa.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆1993年在闵行校区下院西侧的高学长</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuPOwd_0dPwsrbOSaiQ9XxRTOgqS.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆87级军训 83026部队71分队10班合照</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnNJoet8Tb2w2nfe-9W-7zESaeQ4.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆1996年菁菁堂百年校庆晚会（左一高学长）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjPL_5Y_Qpd1vwxYNkbxztccCuiN.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆年轻的史炎和他所深爱的交大--包玉刚图书馆前</span></p><span></span><p><span>🕐本期时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="196">00:03:16</a> 第一届的军训有多野？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="557">00:09:17</a> 交通大学通勤的交通变迁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1280">00:21:20</a> 粮票肉票香烟票…票证年代</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">00:35:00</a>高校有地位，江湖有传说：钓小龙虾是传统艺能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3158">00:52:38</a>交大是怎么给交大学生过生日的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4098">01:08:18</a>青春crazy！庆祝狂欢的方式是扔东西!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4460">01:14:20</a>交大发布官方通知的媒介变迁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1135">00:18:55</a>多姿多彩的娱乐方式是爱交大的千百种理由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5959">01:39:19</a>挑粪挖渠、插秧摘椒、金工实习，交大人要修的可太多了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6286">01:44:46</a>那些年，我们追过的女孩儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7579">02:06:19</a>毕业后都是怎么联系同学的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7582">02:06:22</a>青春不毕业合唱团</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵bgm：《交大修炼手册》</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：竹取赫夜子</span></p><span></span><p><span>整理发布：竹取赫夜子</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/643d5699ea2628837e622346/luKnzEdwwCNrIc3n5a-khLP7VoQk.m4a" length="134842917" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>02:18:49</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoqQBw2S7scL8IVJ19XhoFrRbJiy.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>山重水复疑无路，我在良渚当村民！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/677f59dc1962f0b7516fe5de</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">677f59dc1962f0b7516fe5de</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 09 Jan 2025 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小冷：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66d02bd0d06ec988f2b0e0dd" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66d02bd0d06ec988f2b0e0dd"><span>《人生玩家LifePlayer》主播</span></a><span>；即刻：</span><a href="https://okjk.co/spIDh6" data-url="https://okjk.co/spIDh6"><span>@冷冷enjoy</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>启师傅：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66018db7875ad135bddd135a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66018db7875ad135bddd135a"><span>《启师傅客厅》主播</span></a><span>；即刻：</span><a href="https://okjk.co/bthTcr" data-url="https://okjk.co/bthTcr"><span>@启师傅今天逛动物园了吗</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>大城市牛马人VS小县城婆罗门？不不不，本期都在酒里了将会带你发现年轻人还有另外的人生选择……我邀请到了前大厂设计师、现独立设计师小冷，前互联网产品经理、现独立开发者启师傅分享在良渚当村民的生活，数字游民为何迁徙良渚，当代年轻人怎样平衡工作与生活、拥抱变化和多样性，为精神价值买的单，关于做自己的自我表达...</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frf84prNjr2iFnIPdEvpw8XYk1DE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>启师傅家一角🖕</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjOexS2ehkQXEoDDISWbZmYXKckn.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>元气小冷在良渚新港村的生态农场🖕</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmphy_GLk210rwsc46vp5lf6ythH.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>大屋顶（村民图书馆）安藤忠雄建筑作品🖕</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft4iEF09boNSVRonfnGsg6da471W.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>小冷在中国美院（良渚校区）拍下的心声🖕</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltj5xQ3YysCPENHyQlpqB-taxsCv.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnZ3ZNS8gTA4DLS3QzLzWKak-0Pr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>启师傅客厅之史炎分享会《幽默一点，总是好的》🖕</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏰本期时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="449">00:07:29</a> 良渚不是大理2.0</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="562">00:09:22</a>在良渚“仰卧起坐”的主要人群</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="662">00:11:02</a>青年养老院的生活方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="903">00:15:03</a>良渚的生活平衡——享城市便利 拥自然风光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1365">00:22:45</a>消费做减法，快乐做加法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1772">00:29:32</a>数字游民都是什么人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2235">00:37:15</a>躺平还是内卷？这次真的松弛了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2284">00:38:04</a>成年人要对自己的未来有预期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2398">00:39:58</a>有限的客厅延伸无限的生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2513">00:41:53</a>单身or已婚，哪类人群比较多?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2709">00:45:09</a>五千年前先人的殡葬选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2859">00:47:39</a>八卦八卦～村民&amp;村民谈恋爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3050">00:50:50</a>良渚文化村就像大学校园</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3209">00:53:29</a>良渚人 露营是手可摘星辰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3674">01:01:14</a>良渚比北京更欢迎你~</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵本期bgm：Y·M·C·A</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：竹取赫夜子</span></p><span></span><p><span>整理：竹取赫夜子、小冷</span></p>]]></description>
